  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "[1.1.0] 2026.09.01\n      * CollisionHelper class with full collision detection and resolution:\n      * Primitives: IsWithinRadius, IsCircleOverlap, ClosestPointRect, ClosestPointCircle, LineLine\n      * Shape to Shape: RectRect, CircleCircle, RectCircle\n      * Point to Shape: PointRect, PointCircle\n      * Line to Shape: LineLine, LineRect, LineCircle\n      * Distance Between Shapes: DistanceRectRect, DistanceCircleCircle, DistanceRectCircle\n      * Raycasting: RaycastRect, RaycastCircle, RaycastAny\n      * Swept Collision (prevents tunneling): SweptRectRect, SweptCircleRect, SweptCircleCircle\n      * Collision Normals: GetCollisionNormal (Rect, Circle, Circle-Circle)\n      * Reflection: Reflect velocity off surfaces\n      * Containment: RectContainsRect, RectContainsCircle, CircleContainsCircle, CircleContainsRect\n      * Pushback: PushRectRect, PushCircleRect, PushCircleCircle\n      * Move and Slide: MoveAndSlideRect, MoveAndSlideCircle\n      * Bounds Conversion: GetCircleBounds (for broadphase optimization)\n      * Rect2 now delegates all collision logic to CollisionHelper",
